IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. COBOLFETCH.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 HOSTNAME PIC X(256).
01 HOSTLEN PIC 9(9) COMP-5 VALUE 256.
01 RESULT PIC S9(9) COMP-5.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "gethostname"
        USING BY REFERENCE HOSTNAME
            BY VALUE HOSTLEN
        RETURNING RESULT.
        
    DISPLAY "Hostname: ", HOSTNAME.
    STOP RUN.